    "title": "The Winter Nothingness [4K]",
    "description": "Hello, back with a very early winter wallpaper considering it is the start of the Autumn season lol. This wallpaper took me around 3 months to finish with me working on and off it. This wallpaper actually isn't that hard to animate, I had some good ideas flow in and it only took me like 3 days to complete. It was the initial editing that make this so tedious since its a pretty complex artwork with a lot of static artefacts that I need to brush out alongside the layers I need to separate.\r\n\r\nHowever, I would say that I am really happy with how the wallpaper turned out, probably one of the better wallpapers I have made since the end of my National Service. Also, this will be my last wallpaper before flying back overseas to continue my studies. Don't worry, I will still make wallpapers but perhaps not at the rate as it is for the past few months since I will have to study.\r\n\r\nAs always, I hope you enjoy the wallpaper!\r\n\r\n\r\nMusic:\r\n\r\n[url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LlN8MPS7KQs] øneheart x reidenshi - snowfall [/url]\r\n\r\nOriginal artwork can be found [url=https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/122917193] here (Made by Gracile) [/url]\r\n\r\nBlizzard sound effect from Zapsplat.com",
